      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://touristplaces.guide/top-10-places-to-visit-in-mercier-nature-adventure-and-history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The church was originally built in the early 20th century and has been carefully renovated to preserve its historic charm.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
